vLLM b1388b1 changes for RDNA on ROCm 7.13 (git apply ignores this text before the first diff header).
gfx1201 (R9700, DUB): all hunks below were written for it.
gfx1151 (Strix Halo, SJC pod C, 2026-10-10): all 9 hunks (7 files) apply cleanly and none is newly needed; b1388b1 already
lists gfx1150/gfx1151 in HIP_SUPPORTED_ARCHS and guards the RDNA 3.5 paths in csrc/rocm. What gfx1151 does need is
outside this patch, in lab/pod_a_teacher.sh: PYTORCH_ROCM_ARCH=gfx1151, no amdsmi Python package, and
--mm-encoder-attn-backend TRITON_ATTN for the vision encoder (Torch SDPA's math kernel runs out of memory and the
AOTriton kernels are wrong at ~3.5k tokens).

